# HTTP Examples (DocPass)

### Criar usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_usuario}}

{
  "nome": "Maria",
  "email": "maria@example.com",
  "cpf": "123",
  "telefone": "999",
  "dataNascimento": "1995-02-10"
}

### Buscar usuario
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/usuarios/{{usuario_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_usuario}}

### Atualizar usuario
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/usuarios/{{usuario_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_usuario}}

{
  "nome": "Maria",
  "email": "maria@novo.com",
  "cpf": "123",
  "telefone": "999",
  "dataNascimento": "1995-02-10"
}

### Enviar documento
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/documentos/enviar
Authorization: Bearer {{token_usuario}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="usuarioId"

{{usuario_id}}
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tipoDocumento"

RG
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="arquivo"; filename="rg.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./rg.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Listar documentos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/documentos/usuario/{{usuario_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_usuario}}

### Registrar empresa
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/empresas
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_usuario}}

{
  "nome": "Empresa X"
}

### Conceder consentimento
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/consentimentos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_usuario}}

{
  "usuarioId": "{{usuario_id}}",
  "empresaId": "{{empresa_id}}",
  "escopos": ["perfil", "documentos"]
}

### API empresarial perfil
GET http://localhost:8080/api-empresas/v1/perfil/{{usuario_id}}
X-API-KEY: {{api_key}}

### API empresarial documentos
GET http://localhost:8080/api-empresas/v1/documentos/{{usuario_id}}
X-API-KEY: {{api_key}}
